    {
      "id": "concept-stephen-hawking-media-authority-joke",
      "kind": "concept",
      "promptEs": "Stephen Hawking · físico · sugerencia de cine · aviso",
      "questionEn": "Why does a tentative movie suggestion become major scientific news?",
      "answerEn": "Stephen Hawking's scientific authority makes the listeners and newspaper treat an ordinary film suggestion as if it contained expert knowledge or a warning.",
      "noteEn": "Hawking was a famous theoretical physicist, so the newspaper labels him the smartest man and overinterprets a casual comment outside his field. The official title text escalates the same media distortion: a remark about The Town becomes a declaration about all space and time, followed by questions about whether science should judge Ben Affleck and Matt Damon.",
      "tags": [
        "concept",
